OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 20 DEC
OL,4,G2130FMusic Planet
OL,5,     GKathryn Tickell curates a
OL,6,     Gdazzling selection of roots-based
OL,7,     Gmusic for the festive season. And
OL,8,     GDevonshire folk-singer Jim
OL,9,     GCausley selects a triptych of
OL,10,     Gseasonal Wassails.
OL,11,G2230FNew Music Show
OL,12,     GOn the eve of the Winter
OL,13,     GSolstice, Kate Molleson finds
OL,14,     Gsome tracks for those long, dark
OL,15,     Gwinter nights. And, as usual, the
OL,16,     Gbest and latest in cutting-edge
OL,17,     Gand experimental music.
